# Expandable Mini Player — an Apple-Music-style mini player above a 4-tab bar (react-navigation bottom tabs) that expands to a full-screen sheet on tap (spring), scaling the screen behind it; the sheet is dragged down to collapse (threshold 0.8).
# What this test covers: normalising the start state (the progress is a module-level shared value, so it survives
# closing the demo), every tab, tap-to-expand with the press-scale feedback, short drag down (stays expanded),
# long drag down (collapses), drags released just above and below the threshold, tapping the expanded sheet (ignored),
# interrupting the expand spring with a drag, a rapid expand/collapse cycle, and ending collapsed.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/expandable-mini-player"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait "text" "Happiness does not wait" 10000
wait 800
# A previous session may have left the sheet expanded: tapping the mini player expands it either way (a tap on
# the expanded sheet is ignored), then drag it down. Never drag down on the collapsed screen: that closes the demo.
press 250 757
wait 1200
gesture pan 250 450 0 300 500
wait 1200
# Tabs.
press 150 826
wait 400
press 250 826
wait 400
press 351 826
wait 400
press 75 835
wait 400
# Expand.
press 250 757
wait 1200
# Tapping the expanded sheet is ignored.
press 250 600
wait 500
# Short drag down: stays expanded.
gesture pan 250 500 0 100 500
wait 1000
# Long drag down: collapses.
gesture pan 250 450 0 300 500
wait 1200
# Expand, then drag about to the threshold (0.8 ≈ 175 pt) and release.
press 250 757
wait 1200
gesture pan 250 450 0 150 600
wait 1200
gesture pan 250 450 0 220 600
wait 1200
# Interrupt the expand spring with a drag.
press 250 757
wait 200
gesture pan 250 450 0 250 400
wait 1200
# Rapid expand/collapse cycle.
press 250 757
wait 700
gesture pan 250 450 0 350 250
wait 400
press 250 757
wait 700
gesture pan 250 450 0 350 250
wait 1200
# End collapsed: expand and drag down once more.
press 250 757
wait 1200
gesture pan 250 450 0 300 500
wait 1200
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
